\* All TLC check configs for AntflySnapshotContent.tla, one section per check.
\* Sections are verbatim TLC config syntax; the build extracts them
\* (scripts/tla-cfg.sh). Section names match the make-target check ids.

==== positive
SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyWrongContent = FALSE
    BuggyGcNeededContent = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    AppliedContentMatchesIndex
    TargetContentNotGcBeforeApply
    Safety

==== BadGcNeededContent
\* Expected-failure config for AntflySnapshotContent.tla.
\* Enables a mutant where fetched follower content is GC'd before apply.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyWrongContent = FALSE
    BuggyGcNeededContent = TRUE

INVARIANTS
    TargetContentNotGcBeforeApply

==== BadWrongContent
\* Expected-failure config for AntflySnapshotContent.tla.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyWrongContent = TRUE
    BuggyGcNeededContent = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    AppliedContentMatchesIndex
